### 1. Todoを登録
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ポートフォリオの構成を考える",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-10"
}

### 2. Todoを1件取得
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos/18


### 3. Todoを更新
# /1 は登録したテスト用タスクのIDに変更してください。
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/todos/18
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ポートフォリオの構成を決める",
  "detail": "作品を3件選ぶ",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-12",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. Todoを削除
# /1 は登録したテスト用タスクのIDに変更してください。
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/18

### 5. 入力エラーを確認する
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 2
}

### 6. 履歴書写真を登録
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書の写真を撮る",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### 7. ポートフォリオを登録
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ポートフォリオを整理する",
  "category": "デザイン",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### 8. Java復習を登録
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Javaの復習をする",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### 9. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8081/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "requests.http",
      "version": "1.0"
    }
  }
}

### 10. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8081/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: eb2cb1a1-3d91-4cc8-9512-9a7fcaabef51

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}

### 11. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8081/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: eb2cb1a1-3d91-4cc8-9512-9a7fcaabef51

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_todos",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}